    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDual protagonists that can be switched at will</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch between the two protagonists Kagura Mea and Minato Aqua at will to explore the city freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA variety of VTUBER\u2019s signature skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than a dozen of VTUBER\u2019s signature skills appearing in the game, such as the famous \u201cUi Beam\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDifferent bonds with different VTUBERs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the city, Kagura Mea and  Minato Aqua will fight or talk with different VTUBERs, and different VTUBERs will have different attitudes towards the two protagonists.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDual protagonists that can be switched at will</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch between the two protagonists Kagura Mea and Minato Aqua at will to explore the city freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA variety of VTUBER\u2019s signature skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than a dozen of VTUBER\u2019s signature skills appearing in the game, such as the famous \u201cUi Beam\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDifferent bonds with different VTUBERs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the city, Kagura Mea and  Minato Aqua will fight or talk with different VTUBERs, and different VTUBERs will have different attitudes towards the two protagonists.</p>",
    "short_description": "A fan action game for Meaqua. An ominous vortex &quot;Abyss&quot; appears above the city, and the city's order is collapsing. Kagura Mea and Minato Aqua, who have lost their memories, receive a call from the city. In order to solve the mystery of themselves, they embark on the road to return home.",
